----------------------------------------------------------------------
STATUS -- READ BEFORE RUNNING THIS
----------------------------------------------------------------------

This is experimental, unaudited, consensus-critical software.

It has been verified differentially against Bitcoin Core -- a full mainnet
initial block download from genesis, ending with a UTXO set whose MuHash is
identical to Core's at the same height, repeatedly -- and it has been through
internal and external security review. It has NOT had an independent human
audit of its consensus and cryptographic assembly.

A consensus bug in a Bitcoin node loses money. Run this for study and
evaluation, on a machine you can afford to lose, with no funds near it. For a
node that holds value, run Bitcoin Core (https://bitcoincore.org).

The Apache License disclaims all warranties and limits liability. That is not
boilerplate here; it is the point.

