THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL
----------------------------------------------------------------------

asm/tests/bip340_test_vectors.csv
    The BIP-340 (Schnorr signatures for secp256k1) reference test vectors,
    from the bitcoin/bips repository. BIP-340 is published under
    BSD-2-Clause, its code under BSD-2-Clause OR MIT OR CC0-1.0.

Generated tables read from Bitcoin Core's source
    validation/gen_script_flags.py reads Bitcoin Core's own
    kernel/chainparams.cpp and script/interpreter.h on the machine running it
    and emits an activation table (heights, flag bit positions, and two
    historical block hashes) into bitcoin_script_flags.asm. What is emitted
    is consensus fact rather than expression, and no Bitcoin Core source is
    copied into or redistributed with this tree. Bitcoin Core is MIT-licensed
    (https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin).

Protocol specifications
    This node implements the Bitcoin protocol and the BIPs named in README.md
    and docs/. Implementing a specification is not a derivative work of it.
